    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "KPI targets and evidence",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| # | KPI | Target | How it is measured | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | etcd RPO | **≤ 1 h** | Age of newest snapshot, continuous | Live (pages at 90 min) |\n| 2 | Backup success | **100 %** of attempts | Per-node outcome of every hourly run | Live (ticket on any failure) |\n| 3 | Restore drill freshness | **≤ 7 d** since last success | Weekly isolated restore drill (timer) | Live (ticket at 8 d) |\n| 4 | Control-plane failover RTO | **LB 30 s, control-plane node 60 s** | Game-day drills | Demonstrated 2026-11-21: 3.6 s / 5.3 s / no full outage |\n| 5 | Workload recovery | ≤ 6 min | Not yet drilled | **Defined, unmeasured** |\n| 6 | Control-plane node replacement | ≤ 30 min | Not yet drilled | **Defined, unmeasured** |\n| 7 | Full cluster restore RTO | ≤ 2 h | Not yet drilled (isolated restore only) | **Defined, unmeasured** |\n| 8 | API availability SLO | **99.9 %** over 30 d | `/readyz` through the VIP every 10 s | Live (burn-rate pages) |\n| 9 | Mean time to detect | **≤ 5 min** for a full API outage | `promtool` rule test: fast burn fires by 5 min | Tested in CI; delivery verified to ntfy |\n\nLab objectives for this platform, not production commitments. Unmeasured KPIs are listed so they are not mistaken for achieved ones."
      }
    },
